mesa-ps4 @ 1a59cc1: ORBIS_WSI_SHOT=<n> writes the n-th presented frame of the process, once, to
ORBIS_WSI_SHOT_PATH (default /data/ps4-wine/shot.raw) as width*4 bytes per row in scan-out order, so
the milestone e checks can read back what VideoOut flips while DXVK owns the swapchain
(docs/ps4/MILESTONES.md milestone e; scripts/ps4/fbshot.sh). Applied by scripts/ps4/build.sh mesa.

